== Notes ==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*This feat [[stack]]s with ''diamond soul'' for a maximum possible spell resistance of 70.
*A monk who acquires ''improved spell resistance'' multiple times can become almost untouchable with spells as spell resistance reducing effects (such as [[breach]]es and [[nature's balance]]) have no effect on this type of spell resistance. Obtaining a spell resistance of 67 will cause the monk to resist all spells (that allow resistance) cast by a level 40 caster, even one with [[epic spell penetration]].

==Custom content notes==
*A custom class must have this feat in their feat list, or that class will not be able to select it as a general feat.

